    <string name="help_support_body">StudyTrack ke projeke ya moithuti yeo e diretšwego OPSC6312. \n\nIge e le gore go na le se sengwe seo se bonagalago se phošagetše, goba o na le kgopolo ya app ye, re romele poso gomme re tla boela go wena.</string>
    <string name="help_support_subject">Thekgo ya StudyTrack</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">StudyTrack stores your subjects, tasks and preferences on this device. If you sign in, your account email and password are handled by Firebase Authentication — the app never sees your password. \n\nSubjects and tasks are only sent to the StudyTrack backend when an API endpoint is configured in the build, and AI messages are sent to the configured AI provider so it can answer you. Use Export My Data to see everything the app has stored.</string>
